# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [3.7.0]

### Added

* Add CMake support. (#207) @jenskeiner

### Changed

* Mark the adjoint NFFT compute kernels' buffers `restrict`. (#302) @jenskeiner
* Adjust B-spline order to match actual reach. (#309) @jenskeiner
* Increase effective width of Kaiser-Bessel window to match stencil size. (#300) @jenskeiner
* Form the window's grid offset with one FMA. (#298) @jenskeiner
* Sync vendored m4 macros for compiler option tuning. (#282) @jenskeiner
* Sum the log sinc table as four chains instead of one Horner pass. (#280) @jenskeiner
* Fill the fast-Gaussian run with fixed trip counts to avoid breaking auto-vectorization. (#269) @jenskeiner
* Drop autoconf .c.in templating (#277) @jenskeiner
* Blocked phase recurrence for the NFCT/NFST direct transforms, serial and OpenMP. (#275) @jenskeiner
* Blocked phase recurrence for the nfft direct transforms in all dimensions, serial and OpenMP. (#273) @jenskeiner
* Evaluate B-splines in the Chebyshev basis. (#265) @jenskeiner
* Improve performance and accuracy of B-spline and Sinc-power window evaluations. (#263) @jenskeiner
* Improve efficiency and accuracy of Kaiser-Bessel window evaluations. (#261) @jenskeiner
* Sync with upstream FFTW. (#241) @jenskeiner

### Fixed

* Fix an issue where NFCT and NFST use round to nearest instead flooring for run centering. (#310) @jenskeiner
* Bring NFCT/NFST to parity with NFFT re blocked phase recurrence. (#308) @jenskeiner
* Alleviate issues when multiple OpenMP implementations can be linked on macOS (CMake). (#286) @jenskeiner
* Alleviate issues when multiple OpenMP implementations can be linked on macOS (Autotools). (#287) @jenskeiner
* Fix the node stride of NFSFT_EQUISPACED with NFSFT_MALLOC_X. (#293) @jenskeiner
* Search config.h in CMake build directory before include/. (#285) @jenskeiner
* Have infft.h include its own config.h. (#272) @jenskeiner
* Fix the macOS OpenMP build and cover it in CI (#271) @jenskeiner
* Fix formatting for printf in applications/mri (#209) @michaelquellmalz, [@github-advanced-security[bot]](https://github.com/apps/github-advanced-security)
* Add missing openmp libraries in fastsum_benchomp (#208) @michaelquellmalz, [@github-code-quality[bot]](https://github.com/apps/github-code-quality)
* Fix makefile.am LDFLAGS Typo for fastsum (#201) @AlexBuccheri, @michaelquellmalz
* Fixes for compilation in Windows (#200) @michaelquellmalz

