* Align benchmark allocation to reduce noise. (#304) @jenskeiner
* Optimize benchmark reliability. (#303) @jenskeiner
* Test windows at cutoff where approximation error is actually visible. (#301) @jenskeiner
* Draft the next release separately from a cut release branch. (#291) @jenskeiner
* Attach the make dist archive to published releases. (#289) @jenskeiner
* Add one gate job per build workflow for required status checks. (#290) @jenskeiner
* Devcontainer: Install native Claude Code and remove custom setup script. (#276) @jenskeiner
* Cap OpenMP threads number to reduce jitter in benchmarks. (#262) @jenskeiner
* Reduce noise in OpenMP-enabled precomputation benchmarks. (#260) @jenskeiner
